@startuml 02-containers-runtime
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title Runtime containers — logical deployment boundaries

package "Edge (field / lab)" {
  [DHT22 publisher\n(python: publish_picarx_dht22.py)] as Pub
  [DHT22 sensor\n+ GPIO] as Sensor
}

package "API server (host, VM or container)" {
  [Flask app\n(code/backend)] as Api
  database "SQLite\n(dht22_data.db)" as Db
}

package "Web client" {
  [React SPA + Vite\n(code/frontend)] as Spa
}

Sensor -down-> Pub : periodic readings
Pub -down-> Api : **POST** /api/ingest\n(JSON)
Spa -right-> Api : **GET** /api/latest, /api/history,\n/api/stats, …
Api -down-> Db : read / write

note bottom of Pub
  **PUBLISH_URL** sets the target
  (local on the Pi or remote server).
  PiCarX: **5G Quectel RM520N-GL** as primary;
  **Wi-Fi** fallback when configured.
end note

note bottom of Spa
  The SPA never hits SQLite directly:
  always via the HTTP API (CORS enabled).
end note

@enduml
